# Frontend (`apps/web`)

Next.js App Router, React, TanStack Form + Query, Adonis session auth (`lib/auth`), Tailwind CSS **v4**, shadcn/base-nova under `components/ui/`.

Placement: **`layering`** + **`structure`**. Filled notes: `.trellis/spec/web/frontend/` (ignore **To fill**).

## Naming

Feature/component files: `kebab-case` (`sign-in-form.tsx`); PascalCase exports. Routes: `page.tsx` / `layout.tsx`.

## TypeScript

- Extend `../../tsconfig.base.json`; Next options (`jsx`/`bundler`/`plugins`/`paths` `@/*`) local

## Layout

| Layer | Location | Pattern |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Routes | `app/**` | thin pages; compose features |
| Features | `features/**` | domain UI, forms, feature hooks |
| Design system | `components/ui/` | shadcn atoms only |
| Shared non-feature UI | `components/` | providers/shell |
| Auth client | `lib/auth/` | Adonis session cookie via `/api/auth/*` proxy |
| Server state | `lib/query/` | TanStack Query |
| Client UI state | `stores/` | Zustand UI-only (create when needed) |
| Validation | `lib/validations/` | form Zod; auth bounds from `@elynd/auth/policy`; cross-app → `@elynd/shared` |
| Constants | `constants/` | literals used 2+ times |
| Assets | `public/` | optional (`.gitkeep` OK) |

- Prefer existing `components/ui/`; shadcn CLI; ask before editing `components/ui/**` source
- NEVER use Zustand as SoT for API/server data

## Styling

Tailwind v4 (`@import "tailwindcss"`); semantic tokens over raw colors.

## Auth

Soft UX only: cookie presence in `proxy.ts`, `/me` + **401 → sign-in** in the client.
**Real auth** is Adonis `web` session middleware (and later rate limits / IP rules on the API).
`DELETE /api/auth/logout` is a Next handler so HttpOnly `adonis-session` clears on this origin.
Password/username bounds from `@elynd/auth/policy` until that package is retired — do not re-declare in web Zod.
